        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>1-1/4 Inch Mortise Lock Cylinder, Satin Chrome</b>\r\n<p>\r\n1-1/4\" mortise (threaded) cylinder lock for Adams Rite style <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadbolt-body-th1101\"><b>Mortise Deadbolt</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadlatch-body-th1103\"><b>Mortise Deadlatch</b></a> or \r\n<a href=\"/products/sliding-door-mortise-lock-hookbolt-body-th1102\"><b>Mortise Hookbolt</b></a>, when used on doors 2\" to 2-1/4\" thick.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis 1-1/4\" mortise cylinder is also the standard lock used to control the alarm on <a href=\"/products/touch-bar-rim-exit-device-with-alarm-glo-ed-501alarm-al\"><b>Alarm Exit Device</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available with Yale Cam  <a href=\"/products/1-1-4-inch-mortise-cylinder-with-yale-cam-schlage-keyway\"><b>1-1/4 Inch Mortise Cylinder with Yale Cam</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for DL-CYLTA580CSKD-US26D 1-1/4\" Mortise Lock Cylinder\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyed Mortise Cylinder (threaded to screw into mortise lock body)</li>\r\n<li>Key Cylinder 6-pin Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder Length: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder Diameter: Standard 1-5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Cam: Adams Rite A/R Cam (MS Series Cam)</li>\r\n<li>Includes 3/16\" Stamped Trim Ring</a></li>\r\n<li>Includes 2 Keys</li>\r\n<li> Solid Brass Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Chrome</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1-1/4 Inch Mortise Cylinder Lock",
                "description": "1-1/4\" mortise (threaded) cylinder lock for Adams Rite style Mortise Deadbolt, Mortise Deadlatch or \r\nMortise Hookbolt, when used on doors 2\" to 2-1/4\" thick. This 1-1/4\" mortise cylinder is also the standard lock used to control the alarm on ED-501 Alarm Exit Device.",
